  "prefLabel": "Env-A 2802.06 Submit in writing",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-A 2802.06 “Submit in writing” means to submit required information in documents, including but not limited to reports and notifications, to the department using electronic means, U.S. Postal Service mail, or private delivery service.\n\nSource. #12693, eff 12-22-18",
